Block N (prereg v2 §3, substitute for Letta): Cognee native adapter (cognee 1.6.1) on its embedded stores (SQLite, Ladybug graph, LanceDB); one data item per source object, a revision is delete then add, deletes cascade by provenance as the library does; default HYBRID_COMPLETION context; served model registered as JSON-schema capable so Cognee's own structured-output path decodes under the schema; resume cognifies added-but-uncognified rows; own image (four lock pins differ)

